"children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "Create Blog", "value": "https://www.blogger.com/home#create"}], "value": "https://www.blogger.com/home#create"}, {"role": "text leaf", "name": " "}, {"role": "link", "name": "Sign In", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "Sign In", "value": "https://www.blogger.com/"}], "value": "https://www.blogger.com/"}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "section", "name": ""}, {"role": "section", "name": ""}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "heading", "name": "Thursday, February 2, 2017", "level": 2, "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "Thursday, February 2, 2017"}]}, {"role": "link", "name": ""}, {"role": "heading", "name": "Sport Car Simulator Privacy Policy", "level": 3, "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "Sport Car Simulator Privacy Policy "}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "whitespace", "name": "\n"}, {"role": "text leaf", "name": "VAPP respects the privacy rights of its customers and protects the personal information collected, stored and used in connection with VAPP products, services, applications and websites (the \"Services\"). To further this commitment, we have adopted this Privacy Policy (\"Privacy Policy\") to guide how we collect, store, and use the information you provide us."}]}, {"role": "heading", "name": "I. SCOPE OF THIS PRIVACY POLICY", "level": 3, "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "I. SCOPE OF THIS PRIVACY POLICY"}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "This Privacy Policy applies only to personal information submitted and collected through the Services. By installing, using, registering to or otherwise accessing the Services, you are accepting the practices described in this Privacy Policy. If you do not agree to this Privacy Policy, please do not install, use, register to or otherwise access the Services. VAPP reserves the right to modify this Privacy Policy at reasonable times, so please review it frequently. Your continued used of the Services will signify your acceptance to the changes to this Privacy Policy."}]}, {"role": "heading", "name": "II. INFORMATION COLLECTED", "level": 3, "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "II. INFORMATION COLLECTED"}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "1) We use technologies like cookies (small files stored by your browser), web beacons, or unique device identifiers to anonymously identify your computer or device so we can deliver a better experience. Our systems also log information like your browser, operating system and IP address.\u00a0"}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "2) We do not collect personally identifiable information about you. In other words, we do not collect information such as your name, address, phone number or email address.\u00a0"}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "We do not knowingly contact or collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe we have inadvertently collected such information, please contact us so we can promptly obtain parental consent or remove the information.\u00a0"}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "3) In serving you, we may use or store your precise geographic location, if you give us permission to do so. We do not use or share this data for any other purpose. Many devices will indicate through an icon when location services are operating. We only share this location information with others as approved by you."}]}, {"role": "heading", "name": "III. ACCESS TO PERSONAL INFORMATION", "level": 3, "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "III. ACCESS TO PERSONAL INFORMATION"}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "1) You can sign into your account to see or delete any personally identifiable information we have stored, such as your name, address, email or phone number. You can also contact us by email to request to see or delete this information.\u00a0"}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "2) We remove personally identifiable information (such as your name, address, email or phone number) and other preferences associated with your account promptly after you delete your account. We may retain other data indefinitely."}]}, {"role": "heading", "name": "IV. USE OF INFORMATION COLLECTED", "level": 3, "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "IV. USE OF INFORMATION COLLECTED"}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "1) We may share personally identifiable information (such as name, address, email or phone) with trusted partners in order to provide you with relevant advertising, offers or services.\u00a0"}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "whitespace", "name": "\n"}, {"role": "text leaf", "name": "2) Ad companies may use and collect anonymous data about your interests to customize content and advertising here and in other sites and applications. Interest and location data may be linked to your device, but is not linked to your identity."}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "whitespace", "name": "\n"}, {"role": "text leaf", "name": "3)Analytics companies may access anonymous data (such as your IP address or device ID) to help us understand how our services are used. They use this data solely on our behalf. They do not share it except in aggregate form; no data is shared as to any individual user. Click to see company privacy policies that govern their use of data.\u00a0"}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "whitespace", "name": "\n"}, {"role": "text leaf", "name": "4) We take reasonable steps to secure your personally identifiable information against unauthorized access or disclosure. We encrypt transmission of data on pages where you provide payment information. However, no security or encryption method can be guaranteed to protect information from hackers or human error.\u00a0"}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "whitespace", "name": "\n"}, {"role": "text leaf", "name": "Information we collect may be stored or processed on computers located in any country where we do business.\u00a0"}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "5) To operate the service, we also may make identifiable and anonymous information available to third parties in these limited circumstances: (1) with your express consent, (2) when we have a good faith belief it is required by law, (3) when we have a good faith belief it is necessary to protect our rights or property, or (4) to any successor or purchaser in a merger, acquisition, liquidation, dissolution or sale of assets. Your consent will not be required for disclosure in these cases, but we will attempt to notify you, to the extent permitted by law to do so."}]}, {"role": "heading", "name": "V. UPDATES", "level": 3, "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "V. UPDATES"}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": "This privacy policy was last updated on 21-12-2014. Our privacy policy may change from time to time. If we make any material changes to our policies, we will place a prominent notice on our website or application. If the change materially affects registered users, we will send a notice to you by email, push notification or text."}]}]}, {"role": "section", "name": "", "children": [{"role": "link", "name": "Edit Post", "children": [{"role": "text leaf", "name": " ", "value": "https://www.blogger.com/post-edit.g?blogID=4197179957066938270&postID=3253605405996410167&from=pencil"}], "value": "https://www.blogger.com/post-edit